---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | instabid.live" description="Terms & Conditions for instabid.live digital placement advertising.">
  <article class="clay-box p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 my-4 sm:my-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500">Effective Date: August 22, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">1. Nature of Bids & Advertising Placement</h2>
      <p>
        Bids submitted on instabid.live constitute non-refundable purchases of digital leaderboard advertising placement for the active weekly season. Buyers are paying for position priority and traffic exposure on our public directory.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">2. Prohibited Content & Listings</h2>
      <p>
        We strictly prohibit listings promoting illegal content, sexual/explicit services, scam platforms, or unauthorized invite links (e.g. Telegram/Discord invite spam). Listings violating these guidelines will be removed without refund.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">3. Ownership Verification Requirement</h2>
      <p>
        All bidders must complete our Bio Challenge Verification or OAuth verification prior to listing placement going live. Submitting bids for accounts you do not own or control is strictly prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">4. No Refund Policy</h2>
      <p>
        All completed payments through Stripe are final and non-refundable. If another user outbids your current rank, your listing remains active at the rank position your bid amount secures until the end of the active weekly season.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
